# MEMORY BANK PATHS

Канон: `memory-bank/` в корне. Сессия: `activeContext.md` → `load_now` (§0.5.1 token-economy).

**Когда грузить этот файл:** VAN (создание структуры) или если lean-gate не хватает пути.  
**Не грузить** на IMPLEMENT/TASK/QA — путь режима уже в `_lean/<mode>.mdc`.

**Корень (все роли):** `activeContext.md`, `tasks.md` (index + progress + last 5 events), `tasks/log/` (сквозная хронология, append на FINISH, не грузить на IMPLEMENT), `projectbrief.md`, `productContext.md`, `systemPatterns.md`, `techContext.md`, `style-guide.md`

**As-built карта (все роли, brownfield VAN):** `memory-bank/architecture/` — `index.md` + shards: `overview` · `services` · `data-flow` · `erd` · `workers` · `containers` · `frontend`. Канон процесса: @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-van-brownfield.mdc. **Не резать** (§0.0 architecture). Session VAN-лог остаётся в `back|front|integration/van/`.

**Шаблоны (вне memory-bank):** `.cursor/templates/` — копируются с `.cursor`, без всей `memory-bank/`. Состав: `plan.md` · `decompose/{index,step}.md` · `implement.md` (legacy) · `implement/{index,step}.md` · `implement/integ-{index,step}.md` (INTEG IMPLEMENT) · `integration-{plan,gap,gap-close,contract}.md` · `architecture/{index,overview,services,data-flow,erd,workers,containers,frontend,van-session}.md` · `review.md` · `task-shard.md` · `idea-pipeline.md` · `finish-doc-router.md`

**Split (non-plan, >200 → index + shards).** Plan/gap/**architecture** не резать (§0.0).

| Index | Shard dir | Prefix |
|-------|-----------|--------|
| `systemPatterns.md` | `domain/` | SP |
| `architecture/index.md` | `architecture/` | overview/services/… |
| `back/creative/creative-booking-erd.md` | `back/creative/shards/` | ERD |
| `back/creative/creative-telegram-*.md` | `back/creative/shards/` | TG |

**Backend `memory-bank/back/`:**

| Режим | Папка | Именование |
|-------|--------|------------|
| VAN | `back/van/` | `van-YYYYMMDD.md` (session; карта → `architecture/`) |
| PLAN | `back/plan/` | `plan-<epic_id>.md` + `decompose-<epic_id>/` |
| DECOMPOSE | `back/plan/decompose-<epic_id>/` | `index.md` + `sNN-<slug>.md` (+ `implement`) |
| CREATIVE | `back/creative/<epic_id>/` или `back/creative/` | `creative-<feature>.md` — **с эпиком** под `<epic_id>/`; без эпика — плоско. @.cursor/rules/shared/epic-scoped-paths.mdc |
| IMPLEMENT | `back/implement/implement-<epic_id>/` | `index.md` + `sNN-<slug>.md`. Без эпика: `back/implement/<slug>/` |
| TASK | `back/task/` | `task-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md` |
| BUGFIX | `back/bugfix/<epic_id>/` или `back/bugfix/` | `bugfix-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md` — с эпиком / без |
| REFACTOR | `back/refactor/` | `analysis-<id>.md`, `plan-<id>.md`, `session-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md` |
| REFLECT | `back/reflection/` | `reflection-<task_id>.md` — **не** под epic; **не** переносится ARCHIVE |
| ARCHIVE NOW | `memory-bank/archive/back/` | **move** epic tree (plan/decompose/implement/creative/qa/bugfix); манифест `archive-*.md` **убран**. Канон: @.cursor/rules/shared/epic-scoped-paths.mdc |
| QA | `back/qa/<epic_id>/` или `back/qa/` | `qa-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md` — с эпиком / без |
| SECURITY | `back/security/` | `security-audit-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md` |

**Front `memory-bank/front/`** — та же схема, префикс `front/` + ARCHIVE → `memory-bank/archive/front/`.

| Режим | Папка | Именование |
|-------|--------|------------|
| SECURITY | `front/security/` | `security-audit-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md` |

**Integration `memory-bank/integration/`:**

| Режим | Папка | Именование |
|-------|--------|------------|
| VAN | `integration/van/` | `van-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md` (session; полная карта → `architecture/`) |
| GAP | `integration/gap/` | `gap-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md` |
| GAP CLOSE | `integration/gap/` | `close-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md` |
| PLAN | `integration/plan/` | `plan-<epic_id>.md` |
| DECOMPOSE | `integration/plan/decompose-<epic_id>/` | `index.md` + `eNN-<slug>.md` (+ `implement`) |
| CREATIVE | `integration/creative/<epic_id>/` или плоско | `creative-<feature>.md` |
| IMPLEMENT | `integration/implement/implement-<epic_id>/` | `index.md` + `eNN-<slug>.md` |
| TASK | `integration/task/` | `task-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md` |
| BUGFIX | `integration/bugfix/<epic_id>/` или плоско | `bugfix-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md` |
| REFACTOR | `integration/refactor/` | `analysis-<id>.md`, `plan-<id>.md` |
| REFLECT | `integration/reflection/` | `reflection-<task_id>.md` — не переносится ARCHIVE |
| ARCHIVE NOW | `memory-bank/archive/integration/` | move epic tree; без `archive-*.md` манифеста |
| QA | `integration/qa/<epic_id>/` или плоско | `qa-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md` |
| SECURITY | `integration/security/` | `security-audit-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md` |
| Contracts | `integration/contracts/` | `<domain-slug>.md` |
| Reference | `integration/reference/` | stubs → query-builder skill |

**Корневой архив эпиков:** `memory-bank/archive/{back\|front\|integration}/` — рядом с `back/` / `front/` / `integration/`. Legacy `memory-bank/{role}/archive/` не использовать для новых файлов.

`slug` — латиница. `tasks.md` — append-only. Артефакты режимов — под `back/` | `front/` | `integration/` пока активны; после ARCHIVE NOW — под `archive/…`. Исключение общих index + **`architecture/`**.
